# Claude
.claude/
Claude.md
**/CLAUDE.md

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/

# Flutter / Dart
apps/app/.dart_tool/
apps/app/.flutter-plugins
apps/app/.flutter-plugins-dependencies
apps/app/build/
